  "stageId": null,
  "title": "课后作业",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act4d0/level_act4d0_st05.txt",
  "sourceHash": "16d54c374f6bf7dbc9b22ffc69065133e0e0433181838476192d48c15150950f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一切都是白色的。\n头顶的天空与脚下的地面，目所能及之处，全都被安静的白色填满。\n纯白、寂静、空无一物。\n只有火苗摇曳燃烧。\n从某一个时间点起，悄然侵蚀梦境，又于梦醒时融化消弭。\n“这里是哪里？”\n无人应答。\n“我为什么会在这里？”\n无人应答。\n“我该怎么离开？”\n无人应答。\n“......”\n除了自己之外，谁都不在。\n除了自己之外，什么都没有。\n那么，\n所有的困惑就只剩下一个——\n“你......是什么？”\n......\n............"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "02:35 P.M.  天气/阴转小雨\n罗德岛舰船，二号舱室，干员生活区"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "......呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "（又来了。怎么老做那个梦，那到底什么玩意啊。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "（呃，头都睡扁了，好痛。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "（抓头）烦死了，都是博士那家伙害的，这些题也太难写了吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "这什么怪题目啊，还要求面积？搞什么啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "哇啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "停停停停。不是现在，别烧起来啊喂！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "唔呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "还是把桌角烤焦了......算了，还好作业没事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "博士那家伙......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "喂， 这些一定要都写完吗？真麻烦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "啊？学起来对我有好处？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "废话，这我当然知道，要不然谁要跟你学！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "但是作业也太多了吧！而且这个词和这个词有什么区别啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "就因为我讲了你两句，赫默还拿走了我的辣椒干，这都怪你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "喂，你还笑？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我知道她藏辣椒干的地方。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "真的？！在哪？！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "真要跟你一起拿了，你和我肯定都会挨骂。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "别一直笑啊，又不说话，很奇怪呀！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "你是不是压根就不想回答我啊？",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "炭烤沙虫腿，来一根？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "恶，博士，这是什么？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "拿走拿走，我不要！——唔唔唔？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "唔？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "（咀嚼）呃。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "（吞咽）咕嘟......啊？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "我，我吃了什么？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "算了......",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "对了，博士，赫默明天是不是要去出任务？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "带上我一起，怎么样？我的实力，你知道的对吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "你去和她说说，让我也去看看吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这次行动是收尾，你更擅长战斗吧？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "搞什么，你说的那些我也会啊？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "那为什么我们现在没得战斗，让我去啊，我一定要给其他人看看我的实力！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "这个月投诉有点多，先忍忍吧？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "我这能烧干整个战场的火力，他们就是做不到才嫉妒我吧！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "我才不管那些人怎么说呢！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "赫默和你总该相信我吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "其他人不能理解，我没关系，又不关我的事，",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "但为什么连你们也这么说！为什么呀！",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "伊芙利特，冷静！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "咳！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "烦死了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "算了，去他的。我看看，这题这题还有这题......都填C。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "还有这题......看不太懂，算了随便写写。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "这样就成了......！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医疗干员",
          "text": "到做检查的时间了，伊芙利特。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "恶。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "烦人的家伙来了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医疗干员",
          "text": "怎么一股烧着了的味道......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医疗干员",
          "text": "伊芙利特？打扰一下。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医疗干员",
          "text": "今天要做一个血液源石结晶密度检查，请你配合......嗯？这桌子是怎么回事，怎么被烧焦了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "没什么。就是个意外。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医疗干员",
          "text": "伊芙利特......这样很危险的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医疗干员",
          "text": "罗德岛内部是不允许出现明火的，如果是你的话，更要好好控制。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医疗干员",
          "text": "我跟他们说了，不可以用抑制类的药物，但也需要你好好配合......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "啰嗦死了。烦不烦啊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医疗干员",
          "text": "......伊芙利特，我只是个普通的护士，我不太会带孩子，",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医疗干员",
          "text": "如果可以的话，我们能好好交流......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "谁又是孩子了，你好烦啊？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "为什么我要摊上你这种人，就不能让我一个人呆着吗？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医疗干员",
          "text": "伊芙利特......我也有自己的工作的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "那就别管我的事！说过好多次了，那些穿着白大褂的，我看见就难受！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "快让开，别挡着我出门。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医疗干员",
          "text": "可是，检查......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "我让你别挡路！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "啊！！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "我，我的作业！烧，烧起来了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "你搞什么，搞什么啊？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医疗干员",
          "text": "伊芙利特！快，快灭火！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "都说了，让我一个人待着！！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "你怎么赔我！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医疗干员",
          "text": "不行，不行！我去叫夜莺小姐，请等一下！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "......不，不行。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "我又做了什么啊，可恶......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "哎，作业！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "嗯......破破烂烂的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "（赫默也不肯带上我。可恶，明明我那么强！）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "（现在博士也出去了，就只剩下那些讨人厌的白大褂......）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "（真烦，这么怕我的话干脆就离我远点啊。）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "（本子......稍稍烧焦了一点，不过还行吧？）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "（算了，总之先把练习题放到博士的办公桌上，应该就OK了？）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "有什么事？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "你这样行动，一般干员会被吓到的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "我只是在走路。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "一般干员是不会在墙面上走路的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "算了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "你手上拿的是......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "是作业。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "麻烦。但凯尔希说，这要听博士的。红没得选。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "这里你懂吗？这个词汇。红不理解。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "你居然会......居然会问我问题。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "你不会吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "我试试好了，就先让我看看吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "这个词，嗯，也不是很难理解。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "......大概就是这样。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "这样说，能懂吗？我怕我讲得不好。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "可以。很清楚。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "那就好。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "不过，你其实也可以直接问博士？博士的解答，肯定比我的更准确。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "也可以。但红觉得和霜叶说话轻松。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "......这样。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "你们堵在这干什么呢！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "咦，这不是小红帽吗？真神奇，你居然没直接出现在课堂上......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "——伊芙利特。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "伊芙利特，别那么靠近她。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "红她有很强的防范意识，会下意识地反应，别被伤到。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "防范意识？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "靠近你五厘米的东西会怎么样？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "红切掉。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "你看。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "哈......你这个冰块脸还挺了解她的嘛？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "干员手册我是有好好请教杜宾老师的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "不过红，对别的干员，可以稍微放轻松一些吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "算了......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "噗，哈哈哈哈。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "很好笑？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "唉？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "红，她不是这个意思。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "啧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "嗯......？你藏在背后的是什么？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "啊？哦，是，是作业啦。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "本伊芙利特大人可是轻轻松松做完了啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "是吗......嗯，那就好。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "红闻到了烧焦的味道。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "伊芙利特，作业烧了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "我不是有意的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "哦。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "......你是不是觉得我没完成作业，用火烧掉了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "红不知道。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "想说就说啊，别这样说话。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "别，伊芙利特，红是真的不太会说......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "你生气了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "烦死了，好讨厌啊。我为什么要和你一起上课啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "今天怎么搞的，真是烦透了......怎么这么不走运啊我。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "冷静点，伊芙利特。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "我能感觉到周围的温度在升高，这很危险。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "......啊？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "你懂什么啊？我好得很，别用那种好像什么都知道一样的语气和我说话！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "威胁？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "红，别会错意！她只是习惯了这么说话！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "怪物。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "呃。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "明白。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "你哪里明白了......？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "怪物。\n伤害别人的怪物。烧掉一切的怪物。克制不住自己的怪物。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "我，很痛，很痛啊......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "怪物。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "你要着火了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "等一下，伊芙利特......不是现在。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "关你们什么事？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "怪物。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "你们又懂我哪些了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "怪物。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "快住手！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "她威胁我。不，她威胁到了罗德岛。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "不要动手，红！她只是一时发热！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "你们两个——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "谁发热了？你是不是想说我头脑发热？我清醒得很！你那点冷气根本不顶用，快走开，你也想被烧成灰吗！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "不要。不行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红",
          "text": "控制不了自己。很弱。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "小红帽，你会被烤焦！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "怪物。\n不，不可以，那些是朋友。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "别！伊芙利特！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "怪物！\n不！我不是！！\n火焰在燃烧。\n火焰在疯狂地燃烧。\n巨大的怪物咯咯直笑。\n白色的房间被烧的又黑又焦。\n有人在哭，有人在跑。\n哎呀，这是哪里呢？\n有人走了过来，好熟悉，好高......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "不要......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "塞......救......大家......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "哎呀，哎呀哎呀，大家这是在做什么呢。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "伊芙芙？在走廊上点火可不行哦。塞雷娅知道了会生气的。当然，赫默也是。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "去......！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "不，不是......你不是......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "水分子的集群，去让火焰安静下来吧......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "噗哈——这水也太冰了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "哎......缪缪？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "缪缪，帮帮我......我不想......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "嘘——可不要告诉其他人我来玩哦。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "没问题！就交给我吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "呵呵，看到你还是这么有精神，我就放心啦。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "不过，要好好遵守我们之间约定哦，伊芙芙？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "粗暴。\n肆意。\n横行。\n总是在破坏。\n......\n我自己其实也是知道的。\n会痛的实验让人讨厌。\n那些白大褂的目光让人讨厌。\n这 片 大 地 让 人 讨 厌。\n说什么人生。\n说什么未来。\n只要我放一把火，只要火烧得够旺，所有那些用讨厌眼神看着我的人，那些白色的墙壁和刺鼻的消毒水，所有所有，全都会消失在火中。\n只要我喜欢的人还在就好了。\n其他人怎么样关我什么事？\n——在来到这里之前，我一直是这么想的。\n我一直觉得自己是这么想的。\n但是现在不一样了。\n粗暴。\n哎我当然知道。\n肆意。\n行啦我会小心点的。\n横行。\n......也没那么严重吧？\n总是在破坏。\n我也不想的啊！\n我又不是不明白，很多事情谁想这样啊。\n但至少，哼......\n你们说的，我有照着去做。\n我可不能烧掉罗德岛和作业。\n还有朋友，哼......我的朋友也一定要像我一样了不起呀！\n所以，没事的。我努力的还不够。我还要更加努力！\n看好了，我绝对要让你们大吃一惊！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "哼！！",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "一下子毁了一整条过道？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "才、才没有！烦死了，不要你管！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "唉......小红帽她们呢，没事吧......",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "你让小红帽躲开了？哼，算你识相。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "我有危险？大家都有危险？啊......",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "炭烤沙虫腿，来一根？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "给我也来一根......不、不对！才不要吃啦！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "我也......吃不下去呀。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "那个、走廊的事、唔呃、我也不是有意要破坏的......总之，对、对不起啦！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "可恶，怎么会搞成这个样子......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "对了，不是要检查作业吗？给你！",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这本本子，看起来饱经火灼啊。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "唉，嫌弃的话就别拿啊！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "你能看出来这是什么，对吧。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "交给你了，这就是我的作业。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "出了点小岔子，变成这样......喂，你那是什么表情，你有什么意见吗！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "总之就是这样！不管你信不信，反正我写完了，我真的写完了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "唔，顶、顶多就是撕坏了一点，被火烧了下，又被水浇了下。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "呃呃呃，还有瞎写的题目多了点嘛，今后我会好好写啦！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "我又搞砸了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "你要骂就骂吧。对不起。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "伊芙利特，把手伸出来。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "啊？搞什么啊？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "喏。别打太狠哦！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "唔？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "这个是......干脆鬼椒？我最喜欢的辣椒干！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "欸、啊？是给我的？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "什么啊......搞什么啊！混蛋，我告诉你，可别以为区区这么点零食，就能、就能......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "（大声吸鼻子）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "哈，算你上道！虽然我还是觉得你们这些穿白大褂的家伙有问题！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "你就也勉强算是个例外吧！（小声）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "不过我可警告你！别总是和赫默一样拿我当小孩子看！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "我真的会生气的！生气起来超——可怕的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你是个很优秀的干员。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "呃、呃呃、突然说什么啊，这不是理所当然的吗！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "很有气势啊，伊芙芙。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "噗——咳、咳咳咳。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "谁告诉你这个称呼，不对，谁、谁允许你这样喊我的啊！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "下一次行动，你也出动吧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "！！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "真的假的？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "你的意思是下一次会让我也一起去咯？是这个意思吧？啊？你可别骗我啊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "但是......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "但是什么？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "欸你快说啊，不要让我急啊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "心平气和自己想？那是什么，我不懂你在说......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "对了，得去道歉啊......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "那个每天来看我的姐姐，我不是有意吓她的......我也不想对霜叶她们那么凶......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "唉，博士，帮我个忙吧，你帮我去跟她们说吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "为什么不自己去说呢？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你又吓唬医疗干员了？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "我......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "这次我肯定犯错了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "虽然他们真的很烦人！但我确实不该那么做的吧......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "我也不想你老因为这些事被别人说啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "下次我们去海边玩的话，你要不要去？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "海边？那是啥？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "啊无所谓，要去！我要去！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "呃，不，为什么突然要带我去玩？博士你有点奇怪......",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "因为你表现必须好一点，我才能说服赫默。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "切，什么嘛，还是想让我做这做那对吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "自己去道歉吧？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "哼，放心！包在我身上，不就是道个歉嘛！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "我们约好了对吧？你可不能反悔不带我去哦！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "嘿嘿，海边！嗯，听起来就很有意思呢！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "博士！明天见！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "你是不是还在看？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "哼，我心里清楚得很，那些人怎么看我，怎么想我。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "但这有什么关系？我才不在乎，嘁，我才不要在乎。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "我一定会把你干掉！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "知道吗，就是你老害我丢脸，就是你老让麻烦事缠上我！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "没有我，你是什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "哈，你以为我还像以前一样怕你吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "老让我那么痛，老让所有人都那么痛......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "你这大胖子！傻瓜！肥胖火团！长角的热气球！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "呼呼，有意思。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "你看好了，以后我可不会再什么都烧了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "我可是知道的，有东西能烧，有东西是不能的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "没有不能被焚烧的事物！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "什么呀，我不愿意！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "本伊芙利特大人不愿意烧，那就是不能！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "那些挡着我的路的，我肯定一把火给他们全烧干净。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "但那些不能的，我是绝对不会动的！连一点火我都不会发出来！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "那我等着，小东西。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "迟早有一天......一定！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
